# Product naming

| Context | Name | Examples |
|--|--|--|
| CLI, binary, systemd, Go module, domains, installer | **dockyrd** | `dockyrd serve`, `get.dockyrd.dev`, Apache NOTICE |
| Dashboard UI, logo, aria-labels, marketing copy in app | **Dockyrd** | sidebar wordmark, `aria-label="Dockyrd home"` |
| Repo folder | `dockyrd` | GitHub path only — do not show "dockyrd" in user-facing UI |

When adding strings, pick the row that matches the surface. Do not mix spellings on the same screen without a deliberate rebrand decision recorded in an ADR.
